The '''Empty Chum Bucket''' is an item that can be placed down and filled with {{Item|Chum}}. '''Full Chum Buckets''' can be used to buy items from {{NPCSprite|Moby}}.

== Obtaining ==
An '''Empty Chum Bucket''' can be bought from {{NPCSprite|Moby}} for {{Item|Glowing Mushroom|amount=8}}s and {{C|2k}}.

== Usage ==
=== Fishing ===
'''Empty Chum Buckets''' can be placed next to {{Item|Water}}. While any player's '''Chum Bucket''' is placed nearby, [[Sea Creatures]] killed by the player will drop {{Item|Chum|amount=1}}. The amount of Chum dropped is increased by {{Green|1}} per nearby '''Chum Bucket''', up to {{Green|4}}.

The player can right click on their or another player's '''Chum Bucket''' to deposit their Chum. They will gain {{C|20}} and {{Skill XP|+10 Fishing}} per Chum, which can be increased by the {{Item|Luminous Bracelet}} if the Chum is deposited into another player's '''Chum Bucket'''. Once the player's '''Chum Bucket''' has {{Green|10}} Chum in it, it can be picked up, and will become a '''Full Chum Bucket'''.

If the player walks too far away from their placed '''Chum Bucket''' or warps to a different server, it will be automatically picked up, causing it to lose all Chum inside of it, even if it was full.

=== [[Moby]] ===
'''Full Chum Buckets''' can be used to buy items from {{NPCSprite|Moby}}.

